OL,3,GNEWSAWatch as farmer uses tractor to
OL,4,Ashunt neighbour's truck in road row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer used his tractor to lift and
OL,7,Fmove a neighbour's pick-up truck off
OL,8,Fthe ground, causing enough damage to
OL,9,Fwrite off the vehicle, which has landed
OL,10,Fhim with a ban from using her strip of
OL,11,Froad.
OL,13,FCerdin Jones, 53, from Llanarth in
OL,14,FCeredigion, drove his Massey Ferguson
OL,15,Ftractor into the Fiat Fullback,
OL,16,Fhoisting it up and moving it about 20
OL,17,Fyards (18 metres) through a country
OL,18,Flane.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
