OL,3,GNEWSAWatch as farmer uses tractor to
OL,4,Ashunt neighbour's truck in road row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pick-up truck belonged to
OL,7,Fneighbouring farmer Anwen Hughes and
OL,8,Fwas later written off due to the
OL,9,Festimated #5,000 worth of damage.
OL,11,FHe was found guilty of criminal damage
OL,12,Fto property and was handed a fine and
OL,13,Fgiven a restraining order at
OL,14,FAberystwyth Magistrates' Court last
OL,15,Fmonth.
